// Standard '595 pinout: Q0 is on pad 15, Q1-Q7 on pads 1-7. The Qn outputs
// are 3-state under nOE; Q7S, the serial output, is not.
part 74HCT595 {
    @~footprint    = SOIC-16;
    #value         = 74HCT595;
    @!type         = logic;
    #~mpn          = "74HCT595D,118";
    #!manufacturer = "Nexperia";
    #~lcsc         = "C282339";

    15      : Q[0]>   #VOH=3V7 #VOL=0V4;
    [1:7]   : Q[1:7]> #VOH=3V7 #VOL=0V4;
    8       : GND<    &TYPE=POWER;
    9       : Q7S>    #VOH=3V7 #VOL=0V4;
    10      : nMR<    #VIH=2V #VIL=0V8;   // shift register reset, active low
    11      : SHCP<   #VIH=2V #VIL=0V8;   // shift clock, rising edge
    12      : STCP<   #VIH=2V #VIL=0V8;   // storage clock, rising edge
    13      : nOE<    #VIH=2V #VIL=0V8;   // output enable, active low
    14      : DS<     #VIH=2V #VIL=0V8;
    16      : VCC<    &TYPE=POWER;
};

---

# 74HCT595

**Source:** Nexperia, 74HC595; 74HCT595 product data sheet, Rev. 12, 20 March
2024. SO16 (SOT109-1), 74HCT595D.

8-bit serial-in, serial or parallel-out shift register with output latches;
3-state outputs. TTL-level inputs on the HCT type.

## Pins (Table 2)

| Pin | Name | Function |
|---|---|---|
| 15, 1–7 | Q0, Q1–Q7 | Parallel data outputs, 3-state |
| 8 | GND | Ground |
| 9 | Q7S | Serial data output |
| 10 | MR (active low) | Master reset of the shift register |
| 11 | SHCP | Shift register clock |
| 12 | STCP | Storage register clock |
| 13 | OE (active low) | Output enable |
| 14 | DS | Serial data input |
| 16 | VCC | Supply |

Data shifts on the LOW-to-HIGH transition of SHCP; the shift register is
transferred to the storage register on the LOW-to-HIGH transition of STCP. A
LOW on MR resets the shift register. Q7S allows cascading.

## Limiting values (Table 4)

| Parameter | Value |
|---|---|
| VCC | −0.5 to +7 V |
| Input clamping current IIK | ±20 mA |
| Output clamping current IOK | ±20 mA |
| Output current, Q7S | ±25 mA |
| Output current, Qn | ±35 mA |
| Supply current ICC | 70 mA |

## Recommended operating conditions

| Parameter | Value |
|---|---|
| VCC, 74HCT595 | 4.5 to 5.5 V |

## Static characteristics, 74HCT595, VCC = 4.5 V (Table 6)

| Parameter | Condition | −40 to 85 °C | −40 to 125 °C | Unit |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| VIH min | VCC = 4.5 to 5.5 V | 2.0 | 2.0 | V |
| VIL max | VCC = 4.5 to 5.5 V | 0.8 | 0.8 | V |
| VOH min, Q7S | IO = −4 mA | 3.84 | 3.7 | V |
| VOH min, Qn | IO = −6 mA | 3.7 | 3.7 | V |
| VOL max, Q7S | IO = 4 mA | 0.33 | 0.4 | V |
| VOL max, Qn | IO = 6 mA | 0.33 | 0.4 | V |
| Input leakage | VCC = 6 V | ±1.0 | ±1.0 | µA |
| OFF-state output current | VCC = 6 V | ±5.0 | ±10 | µA |

## Package

SO16, 3.9 × 9.9 mm body, 1.27 mm pitch. Pin 1 at the marked end, numbering
counter-clockwise from the top.
